- REST: `GET /api/users/{id}/purchases`, `GET /api/verifications`, `POST /api/verifications/{id}`,
  `GET /api/trips/{id}/payment` (see `contracts/api.md`, "Judges' demo"); `JudgesIndex` keeps the verification
